{"archive":{"bytes":7811809,"complete":false,"hash":null,"images_lost":false,"truncated":false},"cover_img":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/deploy/flow/ai_official_website/88329/static/image/section_bg.4200b227.png","discovered_at":"2026-09-02T05:49:53.537Z","html":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>应届生招聘（2026 年 9 月—2027 年 8 月毕业的本科、硕士及博士同学）</p>\n<p>实习生招聘（2027 年 9 月及以后毕业的高校在读同学）</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/deploy/flow/ai_official_website/88329/static/image/section_bg.4200b227.png\"/>\n<p>Seed 大模型人才校招，是字节跳动 Seed 面向高校人才推出的招聘项目。 我们始终相信，真正重要的技术进步来自对高难度问题的持续挑战。 面对 AI 时代的巨大机遇，Seed 团队并不止步于模型迭代，而是选择进入技术深水区，推进下一代 AI 范式突破，不断探索智能的边界与上限。 加入这里，你将直接参与打造最前沿的 AI 能力，让下一次突破发生。</p>\n<h2>我们寻找这样的你</h2>\n<img alt=\"outer ellipse\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/deploy/flow/ai_official_website/88329/static/image/outer-ellipse.520bce3a.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"inner ellipse\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/deploy/flow/ai_official_website/88329/static/image/inner-ellipse.3e162024.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"icon\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/deploy/flow/ai_official_website/88329/static/image/looking-for-icon-1.b1b7a132.png\"/>\n<h3>有极强的技术信仰和高远目标</h3>\n<p>以追求智能上限为目标，敢于直面业界 最难问题，有长期主义定力。</p>\n<img alt=\"icon\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/deploy/flow/ai_official_website/88329/static/image/looking-for-icon-3.73c791dc.png\"/>\n<h3>具备出色的研究和实践能力</h3>\n<p>在大模型某一领域有深刻的技术见解和代表性工作，对前沿技术有极强钻研精神，动手能力强。</p>\n<h3>极具好奇心和自驱力</h3>\n<p>对未知保持好奇，思考本质，强烈自我驱动， 愿意为了解决问题发挥最大努力。</p>\n<img alt=\"icon\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/deploy/flow/ai_official_website/88329/s